{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2023-02-22 22:01:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION - NSC', 'text': 'NEW YORK , FEB. 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF\xa0\xa0NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION\xa0("NORFOLK SOUTHERN" OR THE "COMPANY")\xa0(NYSE:\xa0NSC).\xa0 SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S.'}{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2023-02-22 20:37:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN ANNOUNCES EAST PALESTINE TRACK EXCAVATION AND REMEDIATION PLAN', 'text': 'ATLANTA , FEB. 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE: NSC) ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL NOW EXCAVATE THE SOIL AND REPLACE THE TRACKS IN THE DERAILMENT AREA AS PART OF AN ENHANCED REMEDIATION PLAN. THE CHANGE COMES IN RESPONSE TO FEEDBACK FROM THE CITIZENS OF EAST PALESTINE, OHIO.'}{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2023-02-22 17:07:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN ANNOUNCES PAID SICK LEAVE AGREEMENT WITH ENGINEERING RAILROADERS', 'text': "3,000 UNION RAILROADERS TO BENEFIT FROM NEW AGREEMENT ATLANTA , FEB. 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FOLLOWING THE HISTORIC WAGE INCREASES AND PREMIUM HEALTH CARE BENEFITS REACHED DURING LAST YEAR'S NATIONAL BARGAINING,\xa0NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE: NSC) ANNOUNCED WEDNESDAY THAT IT HAS REACHED AN AGREEMENT WITH ONE OF ITS LARGEST LABOR UNIONS THAT PROVIDES THEIR MEMBERS THE ABILITY TO TAKE UP TO SEVEN PAID SICK DAYS PER YEAR. THE NEW SICK LEAVE BENEFIT, REACHED IN COLLABORATION WITH THE BROTHERHOOD OF MAINTENANCE OF WAY EMPLOYEES, IS AVAILABLE TO APPROXIMATELY 3,000 RAILROADERS WHO MAINTAIN THE COMPANY'S TRACK AND INFRASTRUCTURE."}